    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Keane Thompson Estate Agents are delighted to present this superb two-bedroom, two-bathroom townhouse to the market, ideally positioned within the sought-after and secure Ellensborough Lodge development. Offering bright, well-proportioned accommodation together with a private west-facing rear garden, this attractive home is an ideal choice for first-time buyers, investors or those looking to downsize without compromising on convenience.\r\n\r\nPresented in excellent condition throughout, the property has been thoughtfully designed to maximise both space and natural light. The welcoming entrance hall leads to a spacious living room, creating a warm and inviting space to relax or entertain. Double doors connect seamlessly to the modern fitted kitchen, which offers an excellent range of floor and wall units together with direct access to the sunny rear garden.\r\n\r\nUpstairs, there are two generous double bedrooms, both featuring built-in wardrobes. The principal bedroom enjoys the added benefit of a stylish en-suite shower room, while a well-appointed family bathroom completes the first-floor accommodation.\r\n\r\nOutside, the private rear patio provides an ideal setting for outdoor dining, entertaining or simply enjoying the sunshine. The patio benefits from convenient pedestrian rear access. Residents enjoy the security of a gated development together with designated parking.\r\n\r\nEllensborough Lodge is exceptionally well located just minutes from the N81 and M50, providing excellent connectivity to Dublin City Centre and beyond. The nearby Luas Red Line offers a convenient public transport option, while a wide range of local amenities are within easy reach, including neighbourhood shops, cafés, restaurants and The Square Shopping Centre, one of Dublin's premier retail destinations. There is also an excellent selection of schools, parks and leisure facilities nearby, making this a superb location for a wide variety of purchasers.\r\n\r\nAccommodation\r\n68 Sqm Approx\r\n\r\nEntrance Hall\r\nWelcoming entrance hall with intercom system and access to the main living accommodation.\r\n\r\nLiving Room\r\nA bright and spacious reception room featuring timber flooring and an attractive fireplace, creating a comfortable and inviting living space.\r\n\r\nKitchen / Dining Area\r\nModern fitted kitchen complete with an extensive range of floor and wall units, tiled flooring and tiled splashback. Includes understairs storage, gas boiler cupboard and direct access to the rear garden.\r\n\r\nPrincipal Bedroom\r\nGenerous front-facing double bedroom with timber flooring, built-in wardrobes and a private en-suite shower room.\r\n\r\nEn-Suite\r\nFully fitted with shower enclosure, wash hand basin, WC, tiled flooring and extractor fan.\r\n\r\nBedroom Two\r\nSpacious rear-facing double bedroom with timber flooring and fitted wardrobes.\r\n\r\nFamily Bathroom\r\nWell-appointed bathroom comprising bath with overhead shower attachment, wash hand basin, WC, tiled finishes and extractor fan.\r\n\r\nOutside\r\nPrivate rear patio, ideal for outdoor entertaining and benefiting from a pedestrian rear entrance."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Features\r\n•\tSuperb two-bedroom, two-bathroom townhouse\r\n•\tSecure gated residential development\r\n•\tBright and spacious accommodation throughout\r\n•\tWest-facing private rear garden with pedestrian access\r\n•\tGas-fired central heating\r\n•\tDouble glazed windows\r\n•\tDesignated resident parking\r\n•\tPrincipal bedroom with en-suite\r\n•\tExcellent transport links including the M50, N81 and Luas Red Line\r\n•\tClose to The Square Shopping Centre and an excellent range of local amenities\r\n•\tAnnual service charge approximately €925"
